join Lindi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Lindi (Warm)
Lindi: Everything's on a rack. All of it. At dawn.
- Last time?
	Hope: Last time?
	Lindi: Last time I was still sorting at noon and I lost a fifth of it to the heat.
	Lindi: Two years. That's all it took, and it wasn't even clever — it was just some wood and somebody bothering to build it.
[signal arg="hearts:lindi:1"]
set {GameState.quest_lindi_kumbi_kumbi_two} = "complete"
